{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nWhVjFnWh31795496579.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>邵初早前去到埃及旅遊，感受當地沙漠與古蹟風情。她近日在社交平台大晒多張在金字塔前拍攝的花絮照，更鬼馬貼出原版Meme圖對比，並以英文留言：「not the typical pyramid pics, muse: unknown please dm for credit habibi」。</p><p><p><img alt=\"kristyshaw.c_1795435665_4036728018960620490_571245878.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zwOVkQHH7P1795496528.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>曝光的相片中，邵初悉心換上一身全白度假造型，以白色鏤空鈎織頭巾帽配襯短髮，上身穿著若隱若現的白色花卉蕾絲細肩帶背心，下身搭配飄逸白色長褲，頸間還圍上一條隨風輕揚的白色薄紗披肩，在黃沙與藍天映襯下充滿異國氣息。</p><p><p><img alt=\"kristyshaw.c_1795435665_4036727985011718510_571245878.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263vCrXRSGgX1795496535.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>然而邵初一改斯文女神形象，大玩借位攝影，精準複製一位身穿灰衣男士的經典金字塔錯位照。在三組對比圖中，她先是高舉右手、食指朝下精準點在後方金字塔的尖端上；接著側身向前傾，雙手伸直掌心貼齊金字塔的斜面，營造出徒手推金字塔的效果；最後一張她更傾斜上半身，右手握拳抵住頭部側面，讓彎曲的手肘剛好「借位」靠在金字塔頂部，完美重現每一個細節，相當搞笑。</p><p><p><img alt=\"kristyshaw.c_1795435665_4036727953621746383_571245878.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026bEBlBM0PqX1795496542.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:03:53.960615+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":419,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T10:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:17:14.924822+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T10:57:16.534435+00:00","content_hash":"394b25a863432e4ce6b2250b85c349e9c0548ccf7dae8bc8d2d8e060cb294cb1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:03:53.960615+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}